; living-world-expression-progress.fk -- nested call cells appended while
; expression witnesses construct their expensive Form values.
;
; The labels are privacy-safe call identities, not payloads or answers.  Every
; event remains a source-attributed framebuffer cell; the streamed line only
; projects its current phase for an outside observer.  This prelude never
; opens or clears a window: the observing band owns that boundary exactly once.
; preludes: form/form-stdlib/core.fk observe/live-call-framebuffer.fk

(defn lwx-progress (call phase modifier target ordinal file line col)
    (lcfb-call-stream-elapsed
        "living-world-expression" call phase "form-native" modifier target
        ordinal 0 file line col))
